{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54460","headline":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 委任第一（京本作「占委任第一」二十六首） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"攻敌策，谋乃胜之原（京本作「源」）。\n勿使（辛本、川本、京本作「祗」）迎兵（京本作「军」）交血刃，休凭角（京本作「勇」）力靠兵官，勇是祸之端。\n（经曰：善战者不怒，善胜者不争。\n非智者不能行，非贤者不能用也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}